---
// endlesscustomers.com home. About the system; wanting a coach hands off to IMPACT.
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
import { href } from '../../lib/site';
---

<Site site="ec" title="Endless Customers" path="/" description="Endless Customers is the system for becoming the most known, trusted, and recommended company in your market.">
  <section class="hero home">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Become the most known, trusted, and recommended company in your market.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Buyers now ask AI who to hire before they ever call you. Endless Customers is the system for being the answer: say what others won't, show what others hide, and build a team that can keep doing it without an agency.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn grad" href={href('ec', '/book-a-call')}>Book a Free Call</a>
        <a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/instant-diagnostic')}>Take the free instant AI diagnostic <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="book-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cover"><span>Endless<br/>Customers</span></span></div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">The book</p>
          <h2>Start with the book. Most people do.</h2>
          <p class="intro">Endless Customers lays out the whole system: the questions buyers are really asking, the content that answers them, the sales conversations that follow, and how to build a team that owns all of it. If you have read it, the rest of this site is how to put it to work.</p>
          <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 8px;">
            <a class="btn primary" href={href('ec', '/book')}>About the book</a>
            <a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/what-is-endless-customers')}>What is Endless Customers?</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Three ways to implement it</h2>
      <p class="intro">You can run the system yourself, learn it with the Academy, or have a coach install it with your team. Coaching is delivered by IMPACT, the company behind the system, and by certified independent coaches.</p>
      <div class="grid c3">
        <a class="card" href={href('ec', '/how-to-implement')}>
          <h3>On your own</h3>
          <p>The book, the companion guide, and the Learning Center. Free, and it works if you have the discipline and the time.</p>
          <span class="more">How to implement →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href={href('ec', '/academy')}>
          <h3>With the Academy</h3>
          <p>Courses and tools for your team, organized the way the system is organized. For companies that want structure without a coach.</p>
          <span class="more">Endless Customers Academy →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href={href('ec', '/coaching')}>
          <h3>With a coach</h3>
          <p>A certified Endless Customers coach works with your team until the system runs without them.</p>
          <span class="more">Get coaching &amp; training →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid c2">
        <a class="card big" href={href('ec', '/coaches')}>
          <p class="eyebrow">Our coaches</p>
          <h3>Every certified Endless Customers coach, in one place.</h3>
          <p>Who they are, what they have done, and which industries they know. IMPACT's own team and certified independent coaches, listed together.</p>
          <span class="more">Meet the coaches →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card big" href={href('ec', '/success-stories')}>
          <p class="eyebrow">Success stories</p>
          <h3>Companies that did this, and what happened.</h3>
          <p>Stories from clients who reached mastery: the market they were in, what they changed, and the numbers. <span class="tag plan">Content to come</span></p>
          <span class="more">Read the stories →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Keep learning</h2>
      <p class="intro">Everything we publish about the system, free and ungated.</p>
      <div class="grid c4">
        <a class="card" href={href('ec', '/learn')}><h3>Learning Center</h3><p>Articles, videos, and answers, searchable.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href={href('ec', '/conference')}><h3>The Conference</h3><p>Endless Customers Live. Two days with the people doing this.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href={href('ec', '/podcast')}><h3>The Podcast</h3><p>Weekly conversations on trust, content, sales, and AI.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href={href('ec', '/webinars')}><h3>Webinars</h3><p>Live sessions on what is changing and what to do.</p></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow prose">
      <h2>What it costs</h2>
      <p>Implementing Endless Customers has a real cost whether or not you hire anyone: people's time, video, a website that can carry it. The pricing page lays it out in ranges, with and without a coach, so you can decide with your eyes open.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/pricing')}>See pricing <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>

<style>
  .hero.home { padding: 112px 0 88px; }
  .hero.home h1 { max-width: 15ch; }
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .book-art { display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .cover {
    width: 210px; aspect-ratio: 2 / 3; border-radius: 6px 14px 14px 6px; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #16161a, #2a2a31); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.1;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.6), inset 6px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cover::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 18%; height: 10px; background: var(--grad); opacity: .9; filter: blur(.5px); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .cover { width: 150px; font-size: 17px; } .hero.home { padding: 64px 0 48px; } }
</style>
